    "第三方许可": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Third-party Licenses"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "第三方许可"}}}},
    "MPL 组件源码": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MPL component source code"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MPL 组件源码"}}}},
    "以下组件使用 MPL-2.0。打开对应版本链接后，选择 Download 即可取得源码。月读使用这些组件的未修改上游版本；其他组件的许可和版权声明在下方全文列出。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "These components use MPL 2.0. Open an exact-version link below and choose Download to obtain its source code. Moonread uses their unmodified upstream releases. Full licenses and copyright notices for other components follow below."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "以下组件使用 MPL-2.0。打开对应版本链接后，选择 Download 即可取得源码。月读使用这些组件的未修改上游版本；其他组件的许可和版权声明在下方全文列出。"}}}},
    "许可与版权全文": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Full licenses and copyright notices"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "许可与版权全文"}}}},
    "无法读取许可，请重新打开此页面。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Unable to load the licenses. Please reopen this page."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法读取许可，请重新打开此页面。"}}}},
    "正在读取许可…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Loading licenses…"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在读取许可…"}}}},

  "账户目录已提供容量，现已改用目录值。": {
    "localizations": {
