  "Kimi 会员可在 Kimi Code 控制台创建 API Key，然后粘贴到这里。会员权益与工具使用范围以 Kimi 的说明为准；月读不提供 Kimi 账户登录。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Kimi members can create an API key in the Kimi Code console and paste it here. Membership benefits and supported uses are governed by Kimi. Moonread does not offer Kimi account sign-in."
        }
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Kimi 会员可在 Kimi Code 控制台创建 API Key，然后粘贴到这里。会员权益与工具使用范围以 Kimi 的说明为准；月读不提供 Kimi 账户登录。"
        }
