  "服务可能按其政策保存和处理这些内容，并使用该账户的额度。你可以随时在 AI 设置中撤销许可；已发送的数据无法追回。拒绝不会影响阅读。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The service may retain and process this data under its policy and use your account quota. You can withdraw permission in AI settings. Already shared data cannot be recalled. Declining does not affect reading."
        }
      },
