    "展开预览": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expand preview"}}}},
    "收起预览": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collapse preview"}}}},
    "书里写着一条通往山间的小路。雨刚停，石阶还湿着，路边的草叶托着细小的水珠。有人提着灯走在前面，走几步便停下来，回头等一等身后的同伴。远处的屋檐下，一盏旧灯还亮着。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The book described a path into the hills. The rain had stopped, leaving the stone steps wet and small drops resting on the grass. A traveler carried a lantern ahead, pausing every few steps to wait for a companion. Farther on, an old lamp still shone beneath the eaves."}}}},
    "读到这里，她抬头看了看窗外。对面的灯已经熄了，只有楼下那棵树仍在风里轻轻摇动。杯中的水还有一点温度，她握了片刻，又把目光移回书页，接着读那段尚未说完的对话。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"She looked up from the page. The windows across the street were dark, and the tree below still moved gently in the breeze. Her cup held a little warmth. She held it for a moment, then returned to the conversation waiting on the page."}}}},
    "夜还很长，故事也没有结束。她把身体往椅背上靠了靠，换了个舒服的姿势。窗帘在身旁缓慢起落，纸页上的字一句接着一句，把那条陌生的小路，带到了离她很近的地方。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The night stretched ahead, and the story was not finished. She settled more comfortably into the chair. Beside her, the curtain rose and fell slowly. Sentence by sentence, the words brought that unfamiliar path a little closer."}}}},
    "阅读控制": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading controls"}}}},
    "阅读预览": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading preview"}}}},
    "段落": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paragraphs"}}}},
    "亮度": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Brightness"}}}},
    "第一章 月光入窗": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chapter 1 · Moonlight"}}}},
    "晚风吹动窗帘，月光落在翻开的书页上。她把杯子放在窗边，沿着刚才读到的那一句，慢慢看了下去。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An evening breeze stirred the curtain. Moonlight fell across the open pages. She set her cup beside the window and quietly returned to the sentence she had been reading."}}}},
    "街上的声音渐渐远了。故事里的人正走过一座小桥，桥下的流水映着星光，仿佛一伸手，就能触到夏夜的清凉。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The sounds of the street faded away. In the story, someone was crossing a small bridge. Starlight shimmered in the water below, close enough to touch on this cool summer night."}}}},
    "她翻过一页，想知道那个久别的人，最后有没有回到故乡。": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"She turned the page, wondering whether the long-absent traveler had finally found the way home."}}}},
    "月光落在翻开的书页上": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moonlight fell across the open pages"}}}},
    "桥下的流水映着星光": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Starlight shimmered in the water below"}}}},
