  "长按正文选中文字，可以标注、写批注、拷贝、全文搜索或问 AI。跨页选取时，在起点选择“从这里跨页选取”，翻到终点再长按选字，然后选择拷贝或“批注到这里”。": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "长按正文选中文字，可以标注、写批注、拷贝、全文搜索或问 AI。跨页选取时，在起点选择“从这里跨页选取”，翻到终点再长按选字，然后选择拷贝或“批注到这里”。"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Touch and hold text to select it, then highlight, annotate, copy, search the book or ask AI. To select across pages, choose Select across pages from here at the start, move to the end and select text again, then choose Copy or Annotate to here."
        }
      }
